meta {
  name: Admin
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  mr-twin-backoffice's API surface: sync trigger/log, catalog curation
  (publish/unpublish, images), and cross-customer order management.
  Login first — the token auto-saves to {{admin_token}}, which every
  other request in this folder (and the gated requests in Accurate
  Connection) reads. A customer token gets a 403 here, not a 401 —
  see EnsureAdmin middleware.
}
